# Image Assets Directory

This directory is organized for professional stock images from Pexels and Unsplash.

Directory Structure:
├── hero/              - Homepage hero images
├── services/          - Service section images
│   ├── web-development/
│   ├── software-dev/
│   ├── digital-marketing/
│   ├── automation/
│   ├── analytics/
│   └── solutions/
├── about/             - About Us section images
├── trust/             - Client logos and trust indicators
├── portfolio/         - Project showcase images
└── icons/             - UI icons and decorative elements

Naming Convention:
- hero-image.webp - Main hero background
- service-[name]-visual.webp - Service showcase
- team-[n].webp - Team member photos
- project-[n]-preview.webp - Portfolio previews

Image Optimization:
- Format: WebP preferred, with JPEG fallback
- Quality: 80-85% for balance of quality/performance
- Max width: 1920px for hero, 800px for thumbnails
- Compression: ImageOptim or similar

Placeholders will be replaced with actual images.
.gitkeep